==Russian==

===Etymology===
Substantivized neuter of {{m|ru|пе́рвый||first}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пе́рвое|pos=a}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-первое.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|пе́рвое|+}}

# the first thing
#: {{uxi|ru|'''пе́рвое''', [[что]] [[на́до]] [[сде́лать]]|the first thing to be done}}
# {{ellipsis of|ru|пе́рвое [[блю́до]]}}: [[starter]] {{gloss|first [[course]] of a [[meal]]}}
# the first (in dates)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''пе́рвое''' [[март|ма́рта]]|March the 1st}}

